# key-ring: the saved game the key-ring enhanced session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name Avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a key for lock 28 (0x102, owner 28), the lock of
# the castle's locked door at (15, 53), and a key for another lock (0x103, owner 3), into the
# pack, and the player moved beside that door, on (16, 53). Saved in slot 1, described "keys"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
27000 key enter        # the difficulty
30000 key enter
33000 key enter
36000 key enter
39000 key enter
42000 key enter
45000 key enter
48000 key a            # the name
48200 key v
48400 key a
48600 key t
48800 key a
49000 key r
50000 key enter
53000 key enter        # Yes
60100 cheat give 0x102 owner 28
60200 cheat give 0x103 owner 3
60300 cheat goto 1 16 53
64000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "keys"
64100 key s
64300 up ctrl
66000 key enter
67500 key k
67700 key e
67900 key y
68100 key s
69000 key enter
